    "abstract": "Parts figure for the multi-mode receiver installation and the crown-mounted aerial, covering the interface unit, the computer, the circuit card and the neighbouring air data and attitude items in the same rack.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure identifies the multi-mode receiver items in the avionics bay and the transceiver on the crown, together with the rack neighbours that share the same mounting tray.",
      "figure_note": "Sheet 1 shows the avionics bay rack looking forward and sheet 2 shows the crown aerial position. The transceiver at item 40 is common to both aerial positions; only the pad and the coaxial run differ, and the pad is not a parts item because it is installed to the structural drawing. Items 50 and 60 are rack neighbours shown for location only and are detailed on their own figures."
    },
